OpenRC
======

url    = https://github.com/OpenRC/openrc.git
tag    = 0.62.6
commit = c3689317b5b028f96c1e4912ab5281f2719665e5
date   = 2025-07-23

This submodule is source-only. OpenRC is not built, installed, integrated
with boot, or used as PID 1 by FoxynBSD. Keep build output outside it.
The pinned tag points at a commit whose subject says version 0.62.5.

An isolated DragonFly QEMU build failed during Meson configuration; a
separate diagnostic forcing FreeBSD mode failed on MNT_UNION. See
../docs/desktop-integration-investigation.md for the tested scope.

License: see LICENSE and per-file notices. Complete the file-level license
and provenance review before distribution. When upgrading, review OS
support, configuration, service ordering, coexistence with rc.d and recovery,
then test the whole boot path on disposable and physical systems.
